  "question": {
    "text": "Following is the graph between <math> <mrow> <mi>log</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mtext>t</mtext> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </msub> </mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <mi>log</mi><mtext>a</mtext></mrow> </math> (<math> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext><mo>=</mo></mrow> </math> initial concentration of reactant) for a given reaction at <math><msup><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. Hence, order of the reaction is<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/Capture312we.jpg\" style=\"width: 227px; height: 173px;\" /><br />\r(Here,&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>t</mtext> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </msub> </mrow> </math> is half-life)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "R0mJv",
      "text": "<math> <mtext>0</mtext> </math>",
      "image": null,
